WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Maya's birthday gift is delayed after an earlier delivery promise. You play the customer-service representative.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000
First, investigate the order and check what is confirmed before you respond to her concerns.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Across five decisions, choose how to acknowledge the problem, offer help, and arrange follow-up.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Your choices shape the conversation. If you make an unsupported promise, you can still correct it.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The goal is a realistic recovery plan, with clear limits and someone responsible for the next update.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Personalized feedback explains your outcome. Review your decisions, then try again to improve your response.
